This folder started from the React Native app template (@react-native-community/cli init). The files that come from
the template, as changed for this example (the android/ and ios/ projects, index.js, app.json, package.json,
__tests__/, Gemfile, .bundle/, and the Babel, Metro, Jest, ESLint, Prettier, TypeScript and Watchman
configurations), are under the MIT licence below.

Two kinds of template files keep the licence stated in their own headers: the Gradle wrapper (android/gradlew,
android/gradlew.bat, android/gradle/wrapper/), Apache-2.0, and
android/app/src/main/res/drawable/rn_edit_text_material.xml (The Android Open Source Project), Apache-2.0.

App.tsx, schema.ts, README.md and this example's self-check are afterdb's, under the Apache License 2.0 (../LICENSE).

